Klisten MROCompat — dedicated reviewer instructions

Dedicated Klisten reviewer login will be added only to this private review field after authorization. No Google password or API secret is required.

Connect https://api.klisten.co.kr/mcp/mrocompat using only mrocompat:evaluate; select the existing dedicated review key, daily cap $0. Do not top up, buy, pay, issue insurance, file government applications or grant other-product access.

Capabilities and limits: Store supplied fictional or customer-authorized part specifications, compare local registered specifications deterministically, and rank supplied replacement candidates. Does not verify OEM catalogs, physical safety, official replacement approval, inventory, prices, purchases or real-world execution.

Use synthetic supplied data only. Run in order, substituting fresh returned prerequisite IDs/results rather than historical generated values. Use tool schema wrapper {"input":<listed input>}; define each P1 part separately. Choose fresh part UUIDs and update P2-P5 references consistently. Existing exact fictional IDs may already exist from prior testing. No actual replacement safety or OEM approval is inferred. 

